[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0010","text":"那我就在这里等着～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0020","text":"（……明明这么说了\n　却不在────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0030","text":"（往哪边走了呢……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0040","text":"（……！\n　那边……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0050","text":"啊，制作人！\n事情已经办完了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0060","text":"嗯\n──不过，擅自跑掉可不行吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0070","text":"我只动了一小会儿嘛～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0080","text":"落叶，超级多的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0090","text":"──是啊\n那，你打算在这里做什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700300_03_0100","text":"啊哈哈，是啊……"}]
